# 27B, 2 NODES, 8-GPU trainer (for caps up to 128k): node 0 = trainer 8 GPUs TP4 x CP2 headwise; node 1 = two TP4 engines
# (70 in flight). Derived at 128k: 65536 tok/GPU (cap / CP), logprob chunk 4096, expandable_segments for the trainer.
# The only measured layout that fits 128k: REAL 128k 79.0 GB without, 68.3 GB WITH expandable segments (derived from the cap;
# aws-iad 7598871); REAL 96k 56.3 GB (24 GB headroom; DIAG's 96k fallback). 192k needs >= 16 trainer GPUs (all 8-GPU layouts
# OOM). Real-trace tok/s on this layout is still a lower bound (JIT warm-up, dfw 19613127). End to end UNTESTED until the
# validation smoke (experiments/de4-27b-smoke-2n-128k.env). hel/dfw only, --nodes 2.
source "${HM_EXAMPLE_DIR}/configs/models/qwen3.8-27b.env"
NODES=2
LAYOUT=disagg
TRAIN_GPUS=8
TP=4
CP=2
MAX_CAP=131072
